## Phase 2: Backend — API Layer
**Duration:** 3–4 days · **Risk:** Low

### Goal
Build **new** CRUD endpoints for Projects and Hospitals. **All existing form and submission endpoints remain unchanged** — we add new project-scoped routes alongside them.

### 2.1 New Pydantic Schemas

Add to [schemas.py](file:///Users/apple/Desktop/form-creation/backend/schemas.py):

```python
# ── Project Schemas ──
class ProjectBase(BaseModel):
    name: str
    slug: str
    description: Optional[str] = None

class ProjectCreate(ProjectBase):
    pass

class HospitalSummary(BaseModel):
    id: int
    name: str
    site_code: str
    model_config = ConfigDict(from_attributes=True)

class Project(ProjectBase):
    id: int
    is_active: bool
    created_at: datetime
    hospitals: List[HospitalSummary] = []
    model_config = ConfigDict(from_attributes=True)

# ── Hospital Schemas ──
class HospitalBase(BaseModel):
    name: str
    site_code: str
    address: Optional[str] = None
    contact_info: Optional[Dict[str, Any]] = None

class HospitalCreate(HospitalBase):
    pass

class Hospital(HospitalBase):
    id: int
    project_id: int
    is_active: bool
    created_at: datetime
    model_config = ConfigDict(from_attributes=True)
```

### 2.2 New API Endpoints

Add to [main.py](file:///Users/apple/Desktop/form-creation/backend/main.py):

| Method | Route | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `POST` | `/api/admin/projects` | Create a new Project |
| `GET` | `/api/admin/projects` | List all Projects |
| `GET` | `/api/admin/projects/{id}` | Get Project details + hospitals |
| `PUT` | `/api/admin/projects/{id}` | Update Project |
| `DELETE` | `/api/admin/projects/{id}` | Soft-delete Project |
| `POST` | `/api/admin/projects/{id}/hospitals` | Map a Hospital to a Project |
| `GET` | `/api/admin/projects/{id}/hospitals` | List Hospitals under a Project |
| `DELETE` | `/api/admin/projects/{id}/hospitals/{hid}` | Remove Hospital mapping |
| `GET` | `/api/admin/projects/{id}/forms` | List Forms scoped to a Project |

### 2.3 Existing Endpoints — KEPT AS-IS + New Parallel Route

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **No existing endpoints are modified or removed.** The original `/api/admin/forms` route continues to work for backward compatibility. We add a **new parallel route** for project-scoped form creation.

```python
# ✅ EXISTING — stays exactly as-is (forms without project context)
@app.post("/api/admin/forms", response_model=schemas.Form)
def create_form(form: schemas.FormCreate, ...):
    db_form = models.Form(**form.model_dump(), created_by=admin.id)
    ...  # unchanged

# ✅ EXISTING — all other form routes stay untouched:
# GET  /api/admin/forms
# GET  /api/admin/forms/{form_id}
# PUT  /api/admin/forms/{form_id}/versions/{version_id}
# POST /api/admin/forms/{form_id}/publish
# GET  /api/admin/forms/{form_id}/submissions
# GET  /api/admin/forms/{form_id}/export

# 🆕 NEW — project-scoped form creation (sets project_id on the form)
@app.post("/api/admin/projects/{project_id}/forms", response_model=schemas.Form)
def create_project_form(project_id: int, form: schemas.FormCreate, ...):
    db_form = models.Form(**form.model_dump(), created_by=admin.id, project_id=project_id)
    ...

# 🆕 UPDATED — submission endpoint gains OPTIONAL query params
# Existing calls without params still work identically
@app.post("/api/patient/forms/{form_id}/submissions", response_model=schemas.Submission)
def submit_form(form_id: int, submission: schemas.SubmissionCreate,
                project: str = Query(None),   # optional
                site: str = Query(None),       # optional
                center: str = Query(None),     # optional
                ...):
    # If params are provided, resolve and attach metadata
    # If params are absent, submission works exactly as before
```

### 2.4 Patient API — Context-Aware Filtering

```python
@app.get("/api/patient/forms")
def get_published_forms(
    project: str = Query(None),   # slug filter
    site: str = Query(None),      # site_code filter
    db: Session = Depends(get_db)
):
    query = db.query(Form).join(FormVersion).filter(
        FormVersion.status == "PUBLISHED"
    )
    if project:
        query = query.join(Project).filter(Project.slug == project)
    if site:
        query = query.join(Hospital).filter(Hospital.site_code == site)
    ...
```

### 2.5 Deliverables

- [ ] Project CRUD endpoints (create, read, update, soft-delete)
- [ ] Hospital CRUD endpoints (create under project, list, remove)
- [ ] Form creation scoped to `project_id`
- [ ] Submission API injects `project_id`, `hospital_id`, `center_id`, `submitted_by`
- [ ] Patient forms API supports `?project=` and `?site=` query filters
- [ ] CSV export includes metadata columns
- [ ] All existing endpoints remain backward-compatible

