## Phase 3: Admin UI — Project Management
**Duration:** 4–5 days · **Risk:** Medium (largest UI change)

### Goal
Add new Project & Hospital management pages **upstream** of the existing form flow. The FormBuilder and its internal behavior are **not modified**.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **FormBuilder.jsx is NOT changed internally.** The drag-and-drop builder, field configuration, schema editing, preview, conditional logic, version management, and publish flow all remain exactly as they are today. We only change **how you navigate to** the builder (through a project context) and **which `project_id`** gets attached to the form record on creation.

### 3.1 New Routes

Update [App.jsx](file:///Users/apple/Desktop/form-creation/admin-ui/src/App.jsx):

```jsx
<Routes>
  {/* NEW — Project management pages (added upstream) */}
  <Route path="/" element={<ProjectList />} />
  <Route path="/projects/:projectId" element={<ProjectDashboard />} />
  <Route path="/projects/:projectId/hospitals" element={<HospitalManager />} />

  {/* EXISTING — Form routes now nested under project context */}
  {/* FormBuilder and Responses components are IDENTICAL internally */}
  <Route path="/projects/:projectId/builder/:id" element={<FormBuilder />} />
  <Route path="/projects/:projectId/responses/:id" element={<Responses />} />
</Routes>
```

### 3.2 New Pages to Create

| Page | File | Description | Modifies existing code? |
|---|---|---|---|
| **ProjectList** | `pages/ProjectList.jsx` | Cards view of all projects with create modal | **No** — brand new page |
| **ProjectDashboard** | `pages/ProjectDashboard.jsx` | Overview: hospital count, form count, submission stats, links to builder | **No** — brand new page |
| **HospitalManager** | `pages/HospitalManager.jsx` | Add/remove hospitals to the project, assign site codes | **No** — brand new page |

