## Phase 4: Patient UI — Context Awareness & QR
**Duration:** 3–4 days · **Risk:** Low-Medium

### Goal
Make the Patient UI read `project` and `site` from URL parameters, lock context, and submit tagged data.

### 4.1 URL Parameter Handling

The Patient App must parse and persist context from QR-generated URLs:

```
https://patient.haloform.com/fill/5?project=LON_2026&site=BPA&center=camp_A
```

```javascript
// On app load — extract and lock context
const params = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);
const context = {
  project: params.get('project'),
  site: params.get('site'),
  center: params.get('center')
};
localStorage.setItem('haloform_context', JSON.stringify(context));
```

### 4.2 Context-Aware Dashboard

- Filter forms by `?project=LON_2026&site=BPA`
- Display project name and hospital branding at top
- Show only forms assigned to the current project

### 4.3 Submission Metadata Injection

On form submit, silently attach the locked context:

```javascript
const submit = async (formData) => {
  const context = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('haloform_context'));
  await fetch(`/api/patient/forms/${formId}/submissions?` + new URLSearchParams({
    project: context.project,
    site: context.site,
    center: context.center || ''
  }), {
    method: 'POST',
    body: JSON.stringify({ data: formData })
  });
};
```

### 4.4 QR Code Generation (Admin Side)

Add to the Admin UI's Form Builder publish flow:

```javascript
// After publishing, generate context-aware URLs
const publishUrl = `https://patient.haloform.com/fill/${formId}?project=${project.slug}&site=${hospital.site_code}`;

// Generate QR code using qrcode.react or similar
<QRCodeSVG value={publishUrl} size={256} />
```

### 4.5 Deliverables

- [ ] URL parameter parsing + `localStorage` context locking
- [ ] Filtered form listing by project/site
- [ ] Silent metadata injection on every submission
- [ ] QR code generation in Admin UI (per-hospital, per-form)
- [ ] Site-specific branding header (hospital logo, name)
- [ ] Context reset/switch mechanism for field workers

