## Phase 5: Production & Reporting
**Duration:** 3–5 days · **Risk:** Medium

### Goal
Migrate to PostgreSQL, implement row-level security, and build cross-site reporting.

### 5.1 PostgreSQL Migration

Update [database.py](file:///Users/apple/Desktop/form-creation/backend/database.py):

```diff
-SQLALCHEMY_DATABASE_URL = "sqlite:///./forms.db"
+SQLALCHEMY_DATABASE_URL = os.getenv(
+    "DATABASE_URL",
+    "postgresql://haloform:password@localhost:5432/haloform_db"
+)
-engine = create_engine(SQLALCHEMY_DATABASE_URL, connect_args={"check_same_thread": False})
+engine = create_engine(SQLALCHEMY_DATABASE_URL)
```

### 5.2 Row-Level Security (RLS)

```sql
-- PostgreSQL RLS policy
ALTER TABLE submissions ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;

CREATE POLICY hospital_isolation ON submissions
  USING (hospital_id = current_setting('app.current_hospital_id')::integer);
```

### 5.3 Reporting Endpoints

| Endpoint | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `GET /api/admin/projects/{id}/report` | Aggregate stats across all hospitals |
| `GET /api/admin/projects/{id}/report?site=BPA` | Hospital-specific breakdown |
| `GET /api/admin/projects/{id}/export?format=xlsx` | Full Excel export with metadata columns |

### 5.4 Data Export Format

```
| Submission ID | Project | Hospital | Center | Submitted By | Submitted At | Field 1 | Field 2 | ... |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | LON_2026 | BPA | camp_A | user_123 | 2026-05-13 | 22 | 19.4 | ... |
| 2 | LON_2026 | MSR | main | user_456 | 2026-05-13 | 35 | 24.1 | ... |
```

### 5.5 Deliverables

- [ ] PostgreSQL connection + env-based config
- [ ] Alembic migration scripts for schema versioning
- [ ] Row-level security policies
- [ ] Project-level aggregate reporting endpoint
- [ ] Hospital-level filtered reporting endpoint
- [ ] Multi-format export (CSV, XLSX) with all metadata columns
- [ ] Docker Compose updated with PostgreSQL service

