## Summary Timeline

```mermaid
gantt
    title HaloFormCraft Migration — Project-Centric Architecture
    dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
    axisFormat %b %d

    section Phase 1: Models
    New models & migration     :p1, 2026-05-16, 3d

    section Phase 2: API
    CRUD endpoints & filters   :p2, after p1, 4d

    section Phase 3: Admin UI
    Project management pages   :p3, after p2, 5d

    section Phase 4: Patient UI
    Context awareness & QR     :p4, after p2, 4d

    section Phase 5: Production
    PostgreSQL & reporting     :p5, after p3, 5d
```

| Phase | Duration | Dependencies | Key Risk |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Phase 1** — Models & Migration | 2–3 days | None | Existing data migration |
| **Phase 2** — API Layer | 3–4 days | Phase 1 | Backward compatibility |
| **Phase 3** — Admin UI | 4–5 days | Phase 2 | Largest scope |
| **Phase 4** — Patient UI | 3–4 days | Phase 2 | Can run parallel with Phase 3 |
| **Phase 5** — Production | 3–5 days | Phases 3 & 4 | PostgreSQL migration |
| **Total** | **~15–21 days** | | |

> [!TIP]
> **Phase 3 and Phase 4 can run in parallel** after Phase 2 is complete, potentially shaving 3–4 days off the total timeline.

